    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>correct substitution into <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\lambda_{max}=\\frac{2.9\\times 10^{-3}}{T}\"></span> OR 9350 K ✓</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p>Attempted use of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L = 4 π b {d}^{2}\"></span> ✓ use of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\\sqrt{\\frac{L}{4\\piσT^{4}}}\"></span> ✓ <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r=1.4\"></span> Gm ✓ Accept a range of values between 1.3 to 1.5 Gm</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"c\"><p><strong>c</strong></p><p>Shows <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r≈2R_{⊙}\"></span> ✓ Correct position on diagram ✓  ✓  [use of 9000 K gives 2.2<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R_{⊙}\"></span>]</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_03\"><img alt=\"Source markscheme diagram 3\" src=\"asset:fig_03\"/></figure></p></section>"
